Thumbs.db
.DS_Store

# Generated crops, REDESIGN.md D.6. The sources in static/src/img/ are
# committed together with their CREDITS.txt; what optimize_photos.py derives
# from them is a build artifact like the stylesheet, and committing twelve
# files per photograph would put the repository's weight in renditions.
# One line per crop in optimize_photos.py: keep the two lists in step.
/static/img/hero/
/static/img/hero-tall/
/static/img/card/
/static/img/band/
/static/img/poster/
